  "clustering_note": "Individual flights within the same calendar date share airport weather and National Airspace System (NAS) shocks, which violates strict i.i.d. independence and inflates standard F-statistics at N=2.92M. Therefore, we also report Daily Cluster-Robust Block-Mean ANOVA F-statistics (aggregating flights to calendar-date \u00d7 group means first) and Welch's heteroscedastic ANOVA. All factors remain highly significant (p < 1e-15) under daily block aggregation."
}